{"id":"657895","name":"姜葱炒鸡","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/657895/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡肉","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"两块"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1小把"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：鸡肉、姜、葱。鸡肉用列表的调料腌制入味。","img":"images/657895/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"起锅烧油，姜片炒至干香。","img":"images/657895/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒入鸡肉。","img":"images/657895/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"两面煎至泛黄。","img":"images/657895/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入半碗清水，焖2~3分钟。","img":"images/657895/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"时间到，水分已收干。","img":"images/657895/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入葱段。","img":"images/657895/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒出葱香味，出锅。","img":"images/657895/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。调味简单，香味十足，适合下饭。","img":"images/657895/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}